~ start_kai
do hide_portrait_for("Ab")
Kai: This one time Cecil and I were playing together with some paper swords.
Kai: Which of course we were not supposed to do.
Kai: we were playing on the living room,  jumping from couch to couch.
Kai: Which of course we were also not supposed to do.
Kai: anyways, we were in the heat of battle right?
Kai: And Cecil had the upper hand.
Kai: So i pulled my ultimate move: the Sword Helicopter 3000.
Kai: A devastating atack, it helped me turn the battle.
Kai: But such a powerful move comes with consecuences.
Kai: the consecuences being: a very expensive lamp and 2 glasses.
Kai: Since i was the winner, my prize was Cecil not saying anything about it.
Kai: ...
Kai: Please dont tell this to my dad.
do call_cutscene_event("ab_knows")
=> END

~ kai_swords
do hide_portrait_for("Ab")
Kai: Do u think Cecil will want to play again when he gets better?
=> END

~ ab_start
do hide_portrait_for("Kai")
Ab: Kai is a good kid. His intentions come from a good place.
Ab: But Cecil...
Ab: there is nothing we can do.
Ab: You know what i mean? 
=> END

~ ab_knows
do hide_portrait_for("Kai")
Ab: Yes, i totally heard that conversation.
Ab: Yes, i already knew about it.
Ab: And yes, Cecil ratted him out.
do call_cutscene_event("reset_ab")
=> END
